# Per-user / per-machine Power BI Desktop state
**/.pbi/localSettings.json

# cache.abf is ignored repo-wide, but this demo MUST ship it: the model is three
# pure DAX calculated tables with no external source, so the cache is tiny (~19 kB)
# and deterministic — and it is the only thing that stops Desktop from showing
# "One or more calculated tables need to be manually refreshed" on first open.
# Zero-setup is the point of this sample, so the rule is negated here.
!**/.pbi/cache.abf
